      name the destination the user lands on, and the helper is untouched here.

      The sheet has no title of its own: `Bottom Sheet / title` carries the TRACK
      and `Bottom Sheet / subtitle` the ARTIST, so both come from the row.

      The undo copy is the owner's. `Отменить` re-inserts the same entity, so
      the row keeps its original addedAt and returns to the position it was
      removed from - see FavoritesViewModel.restoreFavorite, including the one
      field that does not survive.
    -->
